   "text": "•  better / worse: the weakest pair’s strength went up / down\n•  rerouted: other primary links, same weakest strength\n•  ECMP ↔ LFA is not a change: both are protected in every mode",
   "originalText": "•  better / worse: the weakest pair’s strength went up / down\n•  rerouted: other primary links, same weakest strength\n•  ECMP ↔ LFA is not a change: both are protected in every mode",
