   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 150461,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1989851,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S→E  better    S–E TI-LFA (1)    →  S–E Remote LFA (2)\nS→C  better    S–E TI-LFA (1)    →  S–E LFA (3)\nB→A  worse     B–A LFA C (3)     →  B–A Remote LFA (2)\n               C no longer loop-free:  dist(C,A)=2 < dist(C,B)+dist(B,A) = 1+1 = 2 ✗\n               (before: 3 < 10+1 ✓)\nB→E  rerouted  B–A LFA (3)       →  C–B LFA (3)   B now goes B→C→E (2 < 3)",
   "originalText": "S→E  better    S–E TI-LFA (1)    →  S–E Remote LFA (2)\nS→C  better    S–E TI-LFA (1)    →  S–E LFA (3)\nB→A  worse     B–A LFA C (3)     →  B–A Remote LFA (2)\n               C no longer loop-free:  dist(C,A)=2 < dist(C,B)+dist(B,A) = 1+1 = 2 ✗\n               (before: 3 < 10+1 ✓)\nB→E  rerouted  B–A LFA (3)       →  C–B LFA (3)   B now goes B→C→E (2 < 3)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
