   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §13  ·  docs/learn/10-design-checks.md (What-if)  ·  examples/03-ring5-highmetric.yaml, 02-ring5.yaml, 04-isp-core.yaml  ·  checked with whatIf()",
